ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$delete</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$watch</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>等方法</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">定义<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$on</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$off</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$emit</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$off<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span></code>等事件</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">定义<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">_update</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$forceUpdate</code>、<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$destroy</code>生命周期</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">调用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$mount</code>进行页面的挂载</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">挂载的时候主要是通过<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">mountComponent</code>方法</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">定义<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">updateComponent</code>更新函数</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">执行<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">render</code>生成虚拟<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">DOM</code></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">_update</code>将虚拟<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">DOM</code>生成真实<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">DOM</code>结构，并且渲染到页面中</p>\n</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:34',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:34','小米','2023-03-10 18:06:12',0),
(104,5,0,0,'','3','1','Vue中给对象添加新属性界面不刷新?','',0,'<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果为对象添加少量的新属性，可以直接采用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Vue.set()</code></p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果需要为新对象添加大量的新属性，则通过<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Object.assign()</code>创建新对象</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果你实在不知道怎么操作时，可采取<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">$forceUpdate()</code>进行强制刷新 (不建议)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">PS：<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">vue3</code>是用过<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">proxy</code>实现数据响应式的，直接动态添加新属性仍可以实现数据响应式</p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:34',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:34','小米','2023-03-10 18:07:27',0),
(105,5,0,0,'','3','2','了解过vue中的diff算法吗？说说看','',0,'<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>算法是一种通过同层的树节点进行比较的高效算法</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">其有两个特点：</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较只会在同层级进行, 不会跨层级比较</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">在diff比较的过程中，循环从两边向中间比较</li>\n</ul>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>算法的在很多场景下都有应用，在<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">vue</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>中，作用于虚拟<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">dom</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>渲染成真实<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">dom</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>的新旧<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>节点比较。</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>整体策略为：深度优先，同层比较</p>\n<ol dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较只会在同层级进行, 不会跨层级比较</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较的过程中，循环从两边向中间收拢</li>\n</ol>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">当数据发生改变时，订阅者<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">watcher</code>就会调用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">patch</code>给真实的<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">DOM</code>打补丁</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">通过<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">isSameVnode</code>进行判断，相同则调用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">patchVnode</code>方法</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">patchVnode</code>做了以下操作：\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">找到对应的真实<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">dom</code>，称为<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">el</code></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">如果都有都有文本节点且不相等，将<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">el</code>文本节点设置为<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Vnode</code>的文本节点</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">如果<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">oldVnode</code>有子节点而<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>没有，则删除<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">el</code>子节点</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">如果<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">oldVnode</code>没有子节点而<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>有，则将<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>的子节点真实化后添加到<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">el</code></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">如果两者都有子节点，则执行<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">updateChildren</code>函数比较子节点</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">updateChildren</code>主要做了以下操作：\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">设置新旧<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>的头尾指针</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">新旧头尾指针进行比较，循环向中间靠拢，根据情况调用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">patchVnode</code>进行<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">patch</code>重复流程、调用<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">createElem</code>创建一个新节点，从哈希表寻找<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">key</code>一致的<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>节点再分情况操作</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：（建议学习一下）</p>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://juejin.cn/post/6881907432541552648#heading-1\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://juejin.cn/post/6881907432541552648#heading-1</a></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\"><a style=\"box-sizing: border-box; text-decoration-line: none;\" href=\"https://www.infoq.cn/article/udlcpkh4iqb0cr5wgy7f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.infoq.cn/article/udlcpkh4iqb0cr5wgy7f</a></li>\n</ul>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:35',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:35','小米','2023-03-10 18:10:29',0),
(106,5,0,0,'','3','0','axios是什么？','',0,'<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\"><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">axios</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>是一个轻量的<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">HTTP</code>客户端</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">基于<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">XMLHttpRequest</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>服务来执行<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">HTTP</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>请求，支持丰富的配置，支持<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Promise</code>，支持浏览器端和<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Node.js</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>端。自<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Vue</code>2.0起，尤大宣布取消对<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">vue-resource</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>的官方推荐，转而推荐<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">axios</code>。现在<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">axios</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>已经成为大部分<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Vue</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>开发者的首选</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.25em; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1;\">特性</h3>\n<ul dir=\"auto\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding-left: 2em; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', \'Noto Sans\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; font-size: 14px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 21px; widows: 1;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">从浏览器中创建<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">XMLHttpRequests</code></li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">从<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">node.js</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>创建<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">http</code>请求</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">支持<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">Promise</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>API</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">拦截请求和响应</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">转换请求数据和响应数据</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">取消请求</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">自动转换<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\"><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>JSON</code><span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span>数据</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">客户端支持防御<code class=\"notranslate\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 11.8999996185303px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; border-radius: 6px;\">XSRF</code></li>\n</ul>',NULL,'了解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:35',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:35','小米','2023-03-10 18:11:31',0),
(107,5,0,1,'','3','0','Vue中如何检测数组的变化？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">vue中对数组没有进行defineProperty，而是重写了数组的7个方法。 分别是：</p>\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">push</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">shift</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">pop</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">splice</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">unshift</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">sort</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">reverse</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">因为这些方法都会改变数组本身。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">数组里的索引和长度是无法被监控的。</p>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2026-08-15 11:51:05',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:36','小米','2023-03-10 18:15:39',0),
(108,5,0,0,'','3','1','Vue中如何进行依赖收集的？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/6f1dafe073304e1ca756cb61845629c2~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">Vue初始化的时候，挂载之后会进行编译。生成renderFunction。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">当取值的时候，就会搜集watcher，放到dep里面。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">当用户更改值的时候，就会通知watcher，去更新视图。</p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:36',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:36','小米','2023-03-10 18:16:13',0),
(109,5,0,0,'','3','0','如何理解Vue中的模板编译原理？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">这个问题的核心是如何将template转换成render函数。</p>\n<ol style=\"padding-left: 28px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">将template模块转换成ast语法书 - parserHTML</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">对静态语法做标记（某些节点不改变）</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">重新生成代码 - codeGen,使用with语法包裹字符串</li>\n</ol>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:37',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:37','小米','2023-03-10 18:17:01',0),
(110,5,0,0,'','3','0','vue.mixin的使用场景和原理?','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">Vue的mixin的作用就是抽离公共的业务逻辑，原理类似对象的继承，当组件初始化的时候，会调用mergeOptions方法进行合并，采用策略模式针对不同的属性进行合并。 如果混入的数据和本身组件的数据有冲突，采用本身的数据为准。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">缺点：命名冲突、数据来源不清晰</p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:37',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:37','小米','2023-03-10 18:17:29',0),
(111,5,0,0,'','3','0','computed和watch的区别是什么？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">computed和watch都基于watcher来实现的。</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">computed的属性是具备缓存的，依赖的值不发生变化，对其取值时计算属性方法不会重复执行</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">watch是监控值的变化，当值发生改变的时候，会调用回调函数</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:38','小米','2023-03-10 18:18:09',0),
(112,5,0,0,'','3','2','Vue的diff算法原理是什么？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">Vue的diff算法是平级比较，不考虑跨级比较的情况。内部采用深度递归的方式+双指针方式比较</p>\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">先比较两个节点是不是相同节点</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">相同节点比较属性，复用老节点</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">先比较儿子节点，考虑老节点和新节点儿子的情况</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">优化比较：头头、尾尾、头尾、尾头</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">比对查找，进行复用</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:38','小米','2023-03-10 18:18:47',0),
(113,5,0,0,'','3','0','Vue.set方法是如何实现的？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">vue给对象和数组本身都增加了dep属性</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">当给对象新增不存在的属性的时候，就会触发对象依赖的watcher去更新</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">当修改数组索引的时候，就调用数组本身的splice方法去更新数组</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:39','小米','2023-03-10 18:19:14',0),
(114,5,0,1,'','3','1','Vue为什么要用虚拟Dom','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">虚拟dom就是用js对象来描述真实Dom，是对真实Dom的抽象</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">由于直接操作Dom性能低，但是js层的操作效率高，可以将Dom操作转化成对象操作。最终通过diff算法比对差异进行更新Dom</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">虚拟Dom不依赖真实平台环境，可以实现跨平台</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:39','小米','2023-03-10 18:19:36',0),
(115,5,0,0,'','3','0','请说明key的作用和原理','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">Vue在patch过程中，通过key可以判断两个虚拟节点是否是相同节点。</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">没有key会导致更新的时候出问题</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">尽量不要采用索引作为key</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p9-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/1cd5917790ac4d048c86ffe9983ab707~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:40',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:40','小米','2023-03-10 18:20:15',0),
(116,5,0,2,'','3','0','谈谈对组件的理解','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">组件化开发能大幅提高应用开发效率、测试性、复用性</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">常用的组件化技术：属性、自定义事件、插槽</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">降低更新范围，值重新渲染变化的组件</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">高内聚、低耦合、单向数据流</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2026-08-15 10:29:18',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:40','小米','2023-03-10 18:20:35',0),
(117,5,0,1,'','3','0','请描述组件的渲染流程','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">产生组件虚拟节点 -&gt; 创建组件的真实节点 -&gt; 插入到页面</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p9-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/b060c176af4d41a4abd60dc7edced2d8~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2026-08-15 10:29:20',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:41','小米','2023-03-10 18:21:03',0),
(118,5,0,1,'','3','1','请描述组件的更新流程','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">属性更新会触发patchVnode方法，组件的虚拟节点会调用prepatch钩子，然后更新属性，更新组件。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/c5a19f7f110f441faa0aff053e3ed06a~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2026-08-15 09:58:01',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:41','小米','2023-03-10 18:22:40',0),
(119,5,0,0,'','3','0','异步组件原理','',0,'<p><span style=\"color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">先渲染异步占位符节点 -&gt; 组件加载完毕后调用forceUpdate强制更新。</span></p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:43',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:43','小米','2023-03-10 18:23:10',0),
(120,5,0,0,'','3','0','组件的传值方式有哪些？','',0,'<ol style=\"padding-left: 28px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">props和<span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">emit: 父组件向子组件传递数据，通过prop传递。子组件传递数据给父组件是通过</span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mi</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">父组件向子组件传递数据，通过</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">ro</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">传递。子组件传递数据给父组件是通过</span></span></span></span></span>emit事件</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\"><span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">parent,</span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">re</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span></span></span></span></span>children获取当前组件的父组件和当前组件的子组件</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\"><span class=\"math math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\">attrs和</span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">tt</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">rs</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">和</span></span></span></span></span>listeners 。</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">父组件通过provide提供，子组件通过inject注入变量</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">$ref获取实例</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">eventBus平级组件数据传递</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 6px;\">Vuex</li>\n</ol>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:43','小米','2023-03-10 18:23:58',0),
(121,5,0,0,'','3','0','$attrs是为了解决什么问题出现的？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">主要作用是为了实现批量传递数据。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">provide/inject更适合应用在插件中，主要实现跨级数据传递。</p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:44','小米','2023-03-10 18:24:22',0),
(122,5,0,0,'','3','1','Vue的普通Slot以及作用域Slot的区别','',0,'<h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 35px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size: 18px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-id=\"heading-26\">普通插槽</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">普通插槽是渲染后做替换的工作。父组件渲染完毕后，替换子组件的内容。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/d5d2edbc5b6145349d6ccecd01cb7a82~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">在模板编译的时候，处理组件中的子节点和slot标签<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp;</span><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/508c06da3cea4e2cbb2271a565bbcedc~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">在创建元素的时候，用_t()方法方法来替换_v()的内容。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p9-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/8acfee0c25a34b23a991fe9b85164394~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<h3 style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 35px; margin-bottom: 10px; padding-bottom: 5px; font-size: 18px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\" data-id=\"heading-27\">作用域插槽</h3>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">作用域插槽可以拿到子组件里面的属性。在子组件中传入属性然后渲染。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p3-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/2515ece3689249efbd205d2fd6dda57c~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/ef974fde9b1841d4bf5f2624d5951bb3~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">作用域插槽的编译结果：</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p9-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/0a94ce2443aa4eb1809a1de30e52d22b~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p9-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/af45b0d4954642bea25c74cc1d1ce8fe~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:45','小米','2023-03-10 18:25:33',0),
(123,5,0,0,'','3','0','Vue.use是干什么的？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">Vue.use</code>是用来使用插件的。我们可以在插件中扩展全局组件、指令、原型方法等。 会调用<code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">install</code>方法将Vue的构建函数默认传入，在插件中可以使用vue，无需依赖vue库</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p6-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/031b2b04e9224332b8c8413a4f27f243~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 10:03:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:46','小米','2023-03-10 18:32:45',0),
(124,5,0,0,'','3','0','组件写name有啥好处？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">增加name属性，会在components属性中增加组件本身，实现组件的递归调用。</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">可以表示组件的具体名称，方便调试和查找对应的组件。</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'了解',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:46',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:46','小米','2023-03-10 18:33:18',0),
(125,5,0,0,'','3','0','vue的修饰符有哪些？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.stop</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.prevent</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.capture</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.self</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.once</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.passive</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.right</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.center</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.middle</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">.alt</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:47',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:47','小米','2023-03-10 18:34:02',0),
(126,5,0,0,'','3','0','如何理解自定义指令？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">在生成ast语法树时，遇到指令会给当前元素添加directives属性</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">通过genDirectives生成指令代码</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">在patch前，将指令的钩子提取到cbs中，在patch过程中调用对应的钩子</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">当执行cbs对应的钩子时，调用对应指令定义方法</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:47',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:47','小米','2023-03-10 18:34:41',0),
(127,5,0,0,'','3','1','vue-router有几种钩子函数？执行流程如何？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">钩子函数有三种：</p>\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">全局守卫</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">路由守卫</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">组件守卫</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/32a1543889ee492b946868f4adeb5365~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:48',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:48','小米','2023-03-10 18:35:21',0),
(128,5,0,0,'','3','0','vue中使用了哪些设计模式？','',0,'<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">单例模式：new多次，只有一个实例</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal;\"><img style=\"border-style: none; max-width: 100%; margin: 0px;\" src=\"https://p1-juejin.byteimg.com/tos-cn-i-k3u1fbpfcp/2eda03992e4a40abab75781d03102411~tplv-k3u1fbpfcp-zoom-in-crop-mark:4536:0:0:0.awebp\" alt=\"image.png\" loading=\"lazy\" /></p>\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<ul style=\"padding: 0px 0px 0px 28px; margin: 0px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; line-height: 28px;\">\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">工场模式：传入参数就可以创建实例（虚拟节点的创建）</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">发布订阅模式：eventBus</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">观察者模式：watch和dep</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">代理模式：_data属性、proxy、防抖、节流</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">中介者模式：vuex</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">策略模式</li>\n<li style=\"list-style: inherit; margin-bottom: 0px;\">外观模式</li>\n</ul>\n</ul>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:49',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:49','小米','2023-03-10 18:37:20',0),
(129,5,0,1,'','3','0','谈谈你对Vue中响应式数据的理解？','',0,'<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">数组和对象类型的值变化的时候，通过<code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">defineReactive</code>方法，借助了<code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">defineProperty</code>，将所有的属性添加了<code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">getter</code>和<code style=\"font-family: Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', monospace; font-size: 0.87em; word-break: break-word; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto; color: #ff502c; padding: 0.065em 0.4em; background-color: #fff5f5;\">setter</code>。用户在取值和设置的时候，可以进行一些操作。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">缺陷：只能监控最外层的属性，如果是多层的，就要进行全量递归。</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; margin-top: 22px; margin-bottom: 22px; color: #252933; font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, Ubuntu, Cantarell, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Helvetica Neue\', \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', Arial; font-size: 16px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; widows: 1; background-color: #ffffff;\">get里面会做依赖搜集（dep[watcher, watcher]） set里面会做数据更新（notify，通知watcher更新）</p>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:49',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:49','小米','2023-03-10 18:39:18',0),
(130,2,0,3,'','3','0','简述一下你对 HTML 语义化的理解？','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">①<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">用正确的标签做正确的事情。</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">②html 语义化让页面的<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">内容结构化，结构更清晰</span>，便于对浏览器、搜索引擎解析；即使在没有样式 CSS 情况下也以一种文档格式显示，并且是容易阅读的;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">③ 搜索引擎的爬虫也依赖于 HTML 标记来确定上下文和各个关键字的权重，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">利于 SEO</span>;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">④ 使阅读源代码的人对网站更容易将网站分块，<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">便于阅读维护理解</span>。</p>',NULL,'理解',0,1,'2026-08-15 13:45:22',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:50','小米','2023-03-22 12:07:54',0),
(131,2,0,2,'','3','0','Label 的作用是什么？是怎么用的？','',0,'<p><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">：label 标签来定义表单控制间的关系,</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">当用户选择该标签时，浏览器会自动将焦点转到和标签相关的表单控件上</span><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">：label 标签来定义表单控制间的关系,</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bold; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">当用户选择该标签时，浏览器会自动将焦点转到和标签相关的表单控件上</span><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">。</span></p>',NULL,'掌握',0,1,'2026-08-15 13:45:28',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:50','小米','2023-03-22 12:09:18',0),
(132,2,0,0,'','3','0','iframe 框架有那些优缺点？','',0,'<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimHei, Arial, SimSun; font-size: 18px; color: #4f4f4f; line-height: 26px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">优点：</h4>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">iframe 能够原封不动的把嵌入的网页展现出来。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">如果有多个网页引用 iframe，那么你只需要修改 iframe 的内容，就可以实现调用的每一个页面内容的更改，方便快捷。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">网页如果为了统一风格，头部和版本都是一样的，就可以写成一个页面，用 iframe 来嵌套，可以增加代码的可重用。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">如果遇到加载缓慢的第三方内容如图标和广告，这些问题可以由 iframe 来解决。</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', SimHei, Arial, SimSun; font-size: 18px; color: #4f4f4f; line-height: 26px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\"><a id=\"_46\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: none; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; font-weight: normal; cursor: pointer; background-color: transparent; color: #4ea1db; overflow-wrap: break-word;\"></a>缺点：</h4>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">框架结构中出现各种滚动条</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">iframe 会阻塞主页面的 Onload 事件</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">搜索引擎的检索程序无法解读这种页面，不利于 SEO</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">iframe 和主页面共享连接池，而浏览器对相同域的连接有限制，所以会影响页面的并行加载。</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:51',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:51','小米','2023-03-22 13:16:36',0),
(133,2,0,0,'','3','0','HTML 与 XHTML 二者有什么区别，你觉得应该使用哪一个并说出理由。','',0,'<p><span style=\"color: #abb2bf; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; white-space: pre; background-color: #282c34;\">应该使用XHTML，因为XHTML是XML重写了HTML的规范，比HTML更加严格，表现如下： 1、XHTML中所有的标记都必须有一个相应的结束标签； 2、XHTML所有标签的元素和属性的名字都必须使用小写； 3、所有的XML标记都必须合理嵌套； 4、所有的属性都必须用引号&ldquo;&rdquo;括起来； 5、把所有&lt;和&amp;特殊符号用编码表示； 6、给所有属性附一个值； 7、不要在注释内容中使用&ldquo;--&rdquo;； 8、图片必须使用说明文字。</span></p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:51',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:51','小米','2023-03-22 13:17:39',0),
(134,2,0,0,'','3','0','HTML5 的 form 如何关闭自动完成功能？','',0,'<p><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">将不想要自动完成的&nbsp;</span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #c7254e; background-color: #f9f2f4; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">form</code><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;或&nbsp;</span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #c7254e; background-color: #f9f2f4; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">input</code><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">&nbsp;设置为&nbsp;</span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #c7254e; background-color: #f9f2f4; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures;\">autocomplete=off</code></p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:52',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:52','小米','2023-03-22 13:18:13',0),
(135,2,0,1,'','3','0','title 与 h1 的区别、b 与 strong 的区别、i 与 em 的区别？','',0,'<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>①title用于网站信息标题，突出网站标题或关键字，一个网站可以有多个title，seo权重高于H1；H1概括的是文章主题，一个页面最好只用一个H1，seo权重低于title。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>解析：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A.从网站角度而言，title则重于网站信息标题，突出网站标题或关键字用title，一篇文章，一个页面最好只</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>用一个H1，H1用得太多，会稀释主题；一个网站可以有多个title，最好一个单页用一个title以便突出网站页面</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>主题信息。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>B.从文章角度而言，H1则概括的是文章主题，突出文章主题，用H1，面对的用户，要突出其视觉效果。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>C.从SEO角度而言，title的权重高于H1，其适用性要比H1广。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>②b为了加粗而加粗，strong为了标明重点而加粗</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>解析：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>A.b这个标签对应 bold，即文本加粗，其目的仅仅是为了加粗显示文本，是一种样式／风格需求；</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>B.strong这个标签意思是加强字符的语气，表示该文本比较重要，提醒读者／终端注意。为了达到这个目的，浏览器等终端将其加粗显示；</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>③ 同②i为了斜体而斜体，em为了标明重点而斜体，且对于搜索引擎来说strong和em比b和i要重视的多</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-15 13:45:31',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:53','小米','2023-03-22 13:19:03',0),
(136,2,0,0,'','3','0','请描述下 SEO 中的 TDK？','',0,'<p><span style=\"color: #4d4d4d; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">在 SEO 中，所谓的 TDK 其实就是 title、description、keywords 这三个标签，title 标题标签，description 描述标签，keywords 关键词标签</span></p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:53',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:53','小米','2023-03-22 13:19:40',0),
(137,2,0,0,'','3','0','每个 HTML 文件头里都有个很重要的东西，Doctype，知道这是干什么的么？','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">答案：<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #c7254e; background-color: #f9f2f4; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&lt;!DOCTYPE&gt;</code>&nbsp;声明位于文档中的最前面的位置，处于&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-family: \'Source Code Pro\', \'DejaVu Sans Mono\', \'Ubuntu Mono\', \'Anonymous Pro\', \'Droid Sans Mono\', Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, Inconsolata, Courier, monospace, \'PingFang SC\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 22px; color: #c7254e; background-color: #f9f2f4; border-radius: 2px; padding: 2px 4px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">&lt;html&gt;</code>&nbsp;标签之前。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">1.告知浏览器文档使用哪种 HTML 或 XHTML 规范。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">2.告诉浏览器按照何种规范解析页（如果你的页面没有 DOCTYPE 的声明，那么 compatMode 默认就是 BackCompat,浏览器按照自己的方式解析渲染页面）</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">解析：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">doctype 是一种标准通用标记语言的文档类型声明，目的是告诉标准通用标记语言解析器要使用什么样的文档类型定义（DTD）来解析文档。</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">声明是用来指示web浏览器关于页面使用哪个HTML版本进行编写的指令。 声明必须是HTML文档的第一行，位于html标签之前。</span></p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">浏览器本身分为两种模式，一种是标准模式，一种是怪异模式，浏览器通过 doctype 来区分这两种模式，doctype 在 html 中的作用就是触发浏览器的标准模式，如果 html 中省略了 doctype，浏览器就会进入到 Quirks 模式的怪异状态，在这种模式下，有些样式会和标准模式存在差异，而 html 标准和 dom 标准值规定了标准模式下的行为，没有对怪异模式做出规定，因此不同浏览器在怪异模式下的处理也是不同的，所以一定要在 html 开头使用 doctype。</p>',NULL,'',0,1,'2023-03-29 13:10:54',1,'admin','审核通过','2023-03-29 21:10:54','小米','2023-03-22 13:20:45',0),
(138,2,0,0,'','3','0','简述一下 src 与 href 的区别。','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">答案：src 用于引用资源，替换当前元素；href 用于在当前文档和引用资源之间确立联系。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">解析：</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">href<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" />href 标识超文本引用，用在 link 和 a 等元素上，href 是引用和页面关联，是在当前元素和引用资源之间建立联系<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" />若在文档中添加 href ，浏览器会识别该文档为 CSS 文件，就会并行下载资源并且不会停止对当前文档的处理。这也是为什么建议使用 link 方式加载 CSS，而不是使用 @import 方式。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">src<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" />src 表示引用资源，替换当前元素，用在 img，script，iframe 上，src 是页面内容不可缺少的一部分。<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" /><br style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; overflow-wrap: break-word;\" />当浏览器解析到 src ，会暂停其他资源的下载和处理（图片不会暂停其他资源下载和处理），直到将该资源加载、编译、执行完毕，图片和框架等也如此，类似于将所指向资源应用到当前内容。这也是为什么建议把 js 脚本放在底部而不是头部的原因。</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-03-26 07:19:46',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:21:26',0),
(139,2,0,0,'','3','1','严格模式与混杂模式','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">严格模式：以浏览器支持的最高标准运行</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">混杂模式：页面以宽松向下兼容的方式显示，模拟老式浏览器的行为</p>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-03-26 07:19:42',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:21:59',0),
(140,2,0,0,'','3','0','对于 WEB 标准以及 W3C 的理解与认识问题','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">答案：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bolder; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">web 标准</span>简单来说可以分为<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; font-weight: bolder; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">结构、表现和行为</span>。其中结构主要是有 HTML 标签组成。或许通俗点说，在页面 body 里面我们写入的标签都是为了页面的结构。表现即指 css 样式表，通过 css 可以是页面的结构标签更具美感。行为是指页面和用户具有一定的交互，同时页面结构或者表现发生变化，主要是有 js 组成。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">web 标准一般是将该三部分独立分开，使其更具有模块化。但一般产生行为时，就会有结构或者表现的变化，也使这三者的界限并不那么清晰。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">W3C 对 web 标准提出了规范化的要求，也就是在实际编程中的一些代码规范：包含如下几点</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">1.对于结构要求：（标签规范可以提高搜索引擎对页面的抓取效率，对 SEO 很有帮助）</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">1）标签字母要小写</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">2）标签要闭合</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">3）标签不允许随意嵌套</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">2.对于 css 和 js 来说</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">1）尽量使用外链 css 样式表和 js 脚本。是结构、表现和行为分为三块，符合规范。同时提高页面渲染速度，提高用户的体验。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">2）样式尽量少用行间样式表，使结构与表现分离，标签的 id 和 class 等属性命名要做到见文知义，标签越少，加载越快，用户体验提高，代码维护简单，便于改版</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">3）不需要变动页面内容，便可提供打印版本而不需要复制内容，提高网站易用性。</p>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-03-26 07:19:41',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:22:31',0),
(141,2,0,0,'','3','0','列举 IE 与其他浏览器不一样的特性？','',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">答案：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">a. IE 的排版引擎是 Trident （又称为 MSHTML）</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">b. Trident 内核曾经几乎与 W3C 标准脱节（2005 年）</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">c. Trident 内核的大量 Bug 等安全性问题没有得到及时解决</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">d. JS 方面，有很多独立的方法，例如绑定事件的 attachEvent、创建事件的 createEventObject 等</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">e. CSS 方面，也有自己独有的处理方式，例如设置透明，低版本 IE 中使用滤镜的方式</p>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-03-26 07:19:39',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:23:01',0),
(142,0,1,18,'','3','0','前端页面有哪三层构成，分别是什么？作用是什么？','',2,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">答案：分成：结构层、表示层、行为层。</p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word; list-style-type: decimal !important;\">结构层（structural layer）</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">由 HTML 或 XHTML 之类的标记语言负责创建。标签，也就是那些出现在尖括号里的单词，对网页内容的语义含义做出了描述，但这些标签不包含任何关于如何显示有关内容的信息。例如，P 标签表达了这样一种语义：&ldquo;这是一个文本段。&rdquo;</p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\" start=\"2\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word; list-style-type: decimal !important;\">表示层（presentation layer）</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">由 CSS 负责创建。 CSS 对&ldquo;如何显示有关内容&rdquo;的问题做出了回答。</p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\" start=\"3\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; overflow-wrap: break-word; list-style-type: decimal !important;\">行为层（behaviorlayer）</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px; font-size: 16px; color: #4d4d4d; line-height: 26px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">负责回答&ldquo;内容应该如何对事件做出反应&rdquo;这一问题。这是 Javascript 语言和 DOM 主宰的领域。</p>',NULL,'',0,0,'2026-08-16 11:44:09',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:25:24',0),
(143,2,0,0,'','3','0','网页验证码是干嘛的，是为了解决什么安全问题？','',0,'<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 0px 0px 24px; padding: 0px; list-style-position: initial; list-style-image: initial; font-size: 16px; overflow: auto hidden; overflow-wrap: break-word; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.75); font-family: -apple-system, \'SF UI Text\', Arial, \'PingFang SC\', \'Hiragino Sans GB\', \'Microsoft YaHei\', \'WenQuanYi Micro Hei\', sans-serif; font-variant-ligatures: no-common-ligatures; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">区分用户是计算机还是人的公共全自动程序。可以防止恶意破解密码、刷票、论坛灌水</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; outline: 0px; margin: 8px 0px 0px 32px; padding: 0px; list-style: disc; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">有效防止黑客对某一个特定注册用户用特定程序暴力破解方式进行不断的登陆尝试</li>\n</ul>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-03-26 07:19:34',1,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-03-22 13:31:29',0),
(155,0,0,5,'','3','0','【Promise】下面代码的输出是什么？','<p><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Roboto, \'Helvetica Neue\', Arial, \'Noto Sans\', sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Symbol\', \'Noto Color Emoji\'; font-size: 14px',0,'<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4; margin-top: 0px !important;\">解析</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">.then函数中的两个参数。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第一个参数是用来处理Promise成功的函数，第二个则是处理失败的函数。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">也就是说Promise.resolve(\'xxx\')的值会进入成功的函数，Promise.reject(\'xxx\')的值会进入失败的函数。</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">答案</h2>\n<pre style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; margin-top: 0px; overflow: auto; overflow-wrap: normal; line-height: 1.45; background-color: #f6f8fa; border-radius: 6px; color: #24292f; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background: transparent; border-radius: 6px; word-break: normal; border: 0px; display: inline; overflow: visible; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: normal;\">\'error\' \'err!!!\'</code></pre>',NULL,'',0,1,'2026-08-16 11:44:12',1,'admin','审核通过','2026-08-15 20:20:56','小米','2023-04-01 13:50:16',0),
