x-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token exports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span>  \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">10</span><span class=\"token exports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">  attr1</span><span class=\"token exports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span>  \n<span class=\"token exports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">11</span>  attr2  \n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">',NULL,'掌握',0,0,'2026-08-15 11:33:45',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 13:59:38',0),
(164,0,0,0,'','3','1','说说你对闭包的理解，以及闭包使用场景','',0,'<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">一、是什么</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">一个函数和对其周围状态（lexical environment，词法环境）的引用捆绑在一起（或者说函数被引用包围），这样的组合就是闭包（closure）</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">也就是说，闭包让你可以在一个内层函数中访问到其外层函数的作用域</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">在&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">JavaScript&nbsp;</code>中，每当创建一个函数，闭包就会在函数创建的同时被创建出来，作为函数内部与外部连接起来的一座桥梁</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">下面给出一个简单的例子</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">init</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">var</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> name </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #a8ff60;\">\"Mozilla\"</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #7c7c7c;\">// name 是一个被 init 创建的局部变量</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">displayName</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #7c7c7c;\">// displayName() 是内部函数，一个闭包</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">        </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">alert</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">name</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #7c7c7c;\">// 使用了父函数中声明的变量</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">displayName</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">init</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">displayName()</code>&nbsp;没有自己的局部变量。然而，由于闭包的特性，它可以访问到外部函数的变量</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">二、使用场景</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">任何闭包的使用场景都离不开这两点：</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">创建私有变量</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">延长变量的生命周期</li>\n</ul>\n<blockquote style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin: 0px 0px 16px; padding: 0px 1em; color: #57606a; border-left: 0.25em solid #d0d7de; font-size: 16px;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; white-space: pre-line;\">一般函数的词法环境在函数返回后就被销毁，但是闭包会保存对创建时所在词法环境的引用，即便创建时所在的执行上下文被销毁，但创建时所在词法环境依然存在，以达到延长变量的生命周期的目的</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">下面举个例子：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">在页面上添加一些可以调整字号的按钮</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6