g SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">效果如下图所示：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 107px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static.vue-js.com/e3f244e0-a279-11eb-ab90-d9ae814b240d.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">将<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">border</code>设置<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">50px</code>，效果图如下所示：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 302px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static.vue-js.com/ee0b42b0-a279-11eb-ab90-d9ae814b240d.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">白色区域则为<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">width</code>、<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">height</code>，这时候只需要你将白色区域部分宽高逐渐变小，最终变为0，则变成如下图所示：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 182px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static.vue-js.com/2afaa030-a27a-11eb-85f6-6fac77c0c9b3.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">这时候就已经能够看到4个不同颜色的三角形，如果需要下方三角形，只需要将上、左、右边框设置为0就可以得到下方的红色三角形</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 182px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static.vue-js.com/2afaa030-a27a-11eb-85f6-6fac77c0c9b3.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">但这种方式，虽然视觉上是实现了三角形，但实际上，隐藏的部分任然占据部分高度，需要将上方的宽度去掉</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">最终实现代码如下：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-css\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr;