 SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">&lt;</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">/</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">div</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">&lt;</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">div </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">class</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">=</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #a8ff60;\">\"item item-2\"</span><span class=\"