(262,2,0,0,'','3','0','怎么实现“点击回到顶部”的功能？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">下面介绍5种方法进行实现。</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">1、锚点</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">使用锚点链接是一种简单的返回顶部的功能实现。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">该实现主要在页面顶部放置一个指定名称的锚点链接，然后在页面下方放置一个返回到该锚点的链接，用户点击该链接即可返回到该锚点所在的顶部位置。</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24J