n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">某些样式没有提示</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">大量的样式, 代码混乱</p>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">某些样式无法编写(比如伪类/伪元素)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.25em;\">组件中引入css文件</h3>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">将<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">css</code>单独写在一个<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">css</code>文件中，然后在组件中直接引入</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">App.css</code>文件：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" st