inenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">14</span>        &lt;div style={footerStyle}&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">15</span>            All Rights Reserved 2019\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">16</span>        &lt;/div&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">17</span>    )\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">18</span>}</code></div>\n</div>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:05:55',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:05:55',0),
(425,4,0,0,'','3','0','什么是 React？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 16px; margin-top: 0px !important;\">React是一个简单的javascript UI库，用于构建高效、快速的用户界面。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">它是一个轻量级库，因此很受欢迎。它遵循组件设计模式、声明式编程范式和函数式编程概念，以使前端应用程序更高效。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">它使用虚拟DOM来有效地操作DOM。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">它遵循从高阶组件到低阶组件的单向数据流。</p>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:06:25',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:06:25',0),
(426,4,0,0,'','3','1','React.PureComponent 和 React.Component 有什么区别？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">PureComponent 和 Component的区别是：Component需要手动实现 shouldComponentUpdate，而 PureComponent 通过浅对比默认实现了 shouldComponentUpdate 方法。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">浅比较(shallowEqual)，即react源码中的一个函数，然后根据下面的方法进行是不是PureComponent的判断，帮我们做了本来应该我们在 shouldComponentUpdate 中做的事情</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token control-flow\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">if</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">this</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">_compositeType</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">===</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">CompositeTypes</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">PureClass</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">  shouldUpdate </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">!</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">shallowEqual</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">prevProps</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> nextProps</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">||</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">!</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">shallowEqual</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">inst</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">state</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> nextState</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">注意： 浅比较只比较了第一层，复杂数据结构可能会导致更新问题</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">总结: PureComponent 不仅会影响本身，而且会影响子组件，所以 PureComponent 最佳情况是展示组件</p>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:06:43',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:06:43',0),
(427,4,0,0,'','3','0','什么是JSX？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">JSX即JavaScript XML。一种在React组件内部构建标签的类XML语法。JSX为react.js开发的一套语法糖，也是react.js的使用基础。React在不使用JSX的情况下一样可以工作，然而使用JSX可以提高组件的可读性，因此推荐使用JSX。</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">class MyComponent extends React.Component {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>  render() {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>    let props = this.props;  \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>    return (\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>      &lt;div className=\"my-component\"&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>      &lt;a href={props.url}&gt;{props.name}&lt;/a&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>      &lt;/div&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>    );\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">9</span>  }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">10</span>}\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">优点</span>：</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">允许使用熟悉的语法来定义 HTML 元素树；</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">提供更加语义化且移动的标签；</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">程序结构更容易被直观化；</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">抽象了 React Element 的创建过程；</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">可以随时掌控 HTML 标签以及生成这些标签的代码；</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">是原生的 JavaScript。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:06:59',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:06:59',0),
(428,4,0,0,'','3','0','什么是受控组件？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在HTML当中，像&lt;input&gt;,&lt;textarea&gt;, 和&nbsp;&lt;select&gt;这类表单元素会维持自身状态，并根据用户输入进行更新。但在React中，可变的状态通常保存在组件的状态属性中，并且只能用 setState() 方法进行更新。</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">非受控组件</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">非受控组件，即组件的状态不受React控制的组件，例如下边这个</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">import React, { Component } from \'react\';\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>import ReactDOM from \'react-dom\';\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>class Demo1 extends Component {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>    render() {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>        return (\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>            &lt;input /&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>        )\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">9</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">10</span>}\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">11</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">12</span>ReactDOM.render(&lt;Demo1/&gt;, document.getElementById(\'content\'))\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在这个最简单的输入框组件里,我们并没有干涉input中的value展示,即用户输入的内容都会展示在上面。如果我们通过props给组件设置一个初始默认值,defaultValue属性是React内部实现的一个属性,目的类似于input的placeholder属性。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">ps: 此处如果使用value代替defaultValue,会发现输入框的值无法改变</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">受控组件</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">受控组件就是组件的状态受React控制。上面提到过，既然通过设置input的value属性, 无法改变输入框值,那么我们把它和state结合在一起,再绑定onChange事件,实时更新value值就行了。</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">class Demo1 extends Component {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>    constructor(props) {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>        super(props);\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>        this.state = {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>            value: props.value\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>        }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">9</span>    handleChange(e) {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">10</span>        this.setState({\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">11</span>            value: e.target.value\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">12</span>        })\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">13</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">14</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">15</span>    render() {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">16</span>        return (\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">17</span>            &lt;input value={this.state.value} onChange={e =&gt; this.handleChange(e)}/&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">18</span>        )\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">19</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">20</span>}</code></div>\n</div>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:07:15',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:07:15',0),
(429,4,0,0,'','3','0','constructor中super与props参数一起使用的目的是什么？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在调用方法之前，子类构造函数无法使用this引用super()。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在ES6中，在子类的constructor中必须先调用super才能引用this。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在constructor中可以使用this.props</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">使用props：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">class MyComponent extends React.Component {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>    constructor(props) {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>        super(props);\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>        console.log(this.props);  // Prints { name: \'sudheer\',age: 30 }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>}\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">不使用props：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">class MyComponent extends React.Component {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>    constructor(props) {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>        super();\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>        console.log(this.props); // Prints undefined\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>        // But Props parameter is still available\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>        console.log(props); // Prints { name: \'sudheer\',age: 30 }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">9</span>    render() {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">10</span>        // No difference outside constructor\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">11</span>        console.log(this.props) // Prints { name: \'sudheer\',age: 30 }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">12</span>    }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">13</span>}\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">上面的代码片段揭示了this.props行为仅在构造函数中有所不同。外部构造函数相同。</p>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:07:31',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:07:31',0),
(430,4,0,0,'','3','0','什么是高阶组件？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">高阶组件就是一个函数，且该函数接受一个组件作为参数，并返回一个新的组件。基本上，这是从React的组成性质派生的一种模式，我们称它们为&ldquo;纯&rdquo;组件， 因为它们可以接受任何动态提供的子组件，但它们不会修改或复制其输入组件的任何行为。</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">const EnhancedComponent = higherOrderComponent(WrappedComponent);</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">高阶组件（HOC）是 React 中用于复用组件逻辑的一种高级技巧</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">高阶组件的参数为一个组件返回一个新的组件</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">组件是将 props 转换为 UI，而高阶组件是将组件转换为另一个组件</li>\n</ul>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:07:44',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:07:44',0),
(431,4,0,0,'','3','0','React中的类组件和函数组件之间有什么区别？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4; margin-top: 0px !important;\">类组件（Class components）</h2>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">无论是使用函数或是类来声明一个组件，它决不能修改它自己的 props。\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">所有 React 组件都必须是纯函数，并禁止修改其自身 props。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">React是单项数据流，父组件改变了属性，那么子组件视图会更新。\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">属性 props是外界传递过来的，状态 state是组件本身的，状态可以在组件中任意修改</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">组件的属性和状态改变都会更新视图。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">class Welcome extends React.Component {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>  render() {\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>    return (\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>      &lt;h1&gt;Welcome { this.props.name }&lt;/h1&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>    );\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>  }\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>}\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>ReactDOM.render(&lt;Welcome name=\'react\' /&gt;, document.getElementById(\'root\'));\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">函数组件（functional component）</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">函数组件接收一个单一的 props 对象并返回了一个React元素</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">function Welcome (props) {\n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>  return &lt;h1&gt;Welcome {props.name}&lt;/h1&gt;\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>}\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>ReactDOM.render(&lt;Welcome name=\'react\' /&gt;, document.getElementById(\'root\'));\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">区别</h2>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">语法上</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">两者最明显的不同就是在语法上，函数组件是一个纯函数，它接收一个props对象返回一个react元素。而类组件需要去继承React.Component并且创建render函数返回react元素，这将会要更多的代码，虽然它们实现的效果相同。</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">状态管理</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">因为函数组件是一个纯函数，你不能在组件中使用setState()，这也是为什么把函数组件称作为无状态组件。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果你需要在你的组件中使用state，你可以选择创建一个类组件或者将state提升到你的父组件中，然后通过props对象传递到子组件。</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">生命周期钩子</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">你不能在函数组件中使用生命周期钩子，原因和不能使用state一样，所有的生命周期钩子都来自于继承的React.Component中。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">因此，如果你想使用生命周期钩子，那么需要使用类组件。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">注意</span>：在react16.8版本中添加了hooks，使得我们可以在函数组件中使用useState钩子去管理state，使用useEffect钩子去使用生命周期函数。因此，2、3两点就不是它们的区别点。从这个改版中我们可以看出作者更加看重函数组件，而且react团队曾提及到在react之后的版本将会对函数组件的性能方面进行提升。</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">调用方式</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果SayHi是一个函数，React需要调用它：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">// 你的代码 \n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>function SayHi() { \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>    return &lt;p&gt;Hello, React&lt;/p&gt; \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>} \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>// React内部 \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>const result = SayHi(props) // &raquo; &lt;p&gt;Hello, React&lt;/p&gt;\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">如果SayHi是一个类，React需要先用new操作符将其实例化，然后调用刚才生成实例的render方法：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-react\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">// 你的代码 \n</span><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span>class SayHi extends React.Component { \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span>    render() { \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span>        return &lt;p&gt;Hello, React&lt;/p&gt; \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">5</span>    } \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">6</span>} \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">7</span>// React内部 \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">8</span>const instance = new SayHi(props) // &raquo; SayHi {} \n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">9</span>const result = instance.render() // &raquo; &lt;p&gt;Hello, React&lt;/p&gt;\n</code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">可想而知，函数组件重新渲染将重新调用组件方法返回新的react元素，类组件重新渲染将new一个新的组件实例，然后调用render类方法返回react元素，这也说明为什么类组件中this是可变的。</p>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:07:58',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:07:58',0),
(432,4,0,0,'','3','0','什么是虚拟DOM？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">虚拟DOM（VDOM）它是真实DOM的内存表示,一种编程概念，一种模式。它会和真实的DOM同步，比如通过ReactDOM这种库，这个同步的过程叫做调和(reconcilation)。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">虚拟DOM更多是一种模式，不是一种特定的技术。</p>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:08:16',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:08:16',0),
(434,5,0,0,'','3','1','说说vue中的diff算法','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0px !important;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 590px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static.vue-js.com/5e858e30-4585-11eb-85f6-6fac77c0c9b3.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">一、是什么</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>&nbsp;算法是一种通过同层的树节点进行比较的高效算法</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">其有两个特点：</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较只会在同层级进行, 不会跨层级比较</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">在diff比较的过程中，循环从两边向中间比较</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>&nbsp;算法的在很多场景下都有应用，在&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">vue</code>&nbsp;中，作用于虚拟&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">dom</code>&nbsp;渲染成真实&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">dom</code>&nbsp;的新旧&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>&nbsp;节点比较</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">二、比较方式</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>整体策略为：深度优先，同层比较</p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较只会在同层级进行, 不会跨层级比较</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/91/54/91e9c9519a11caa0c5bf70714383f054.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\" start=\"2\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">比较的过程中，循环从两边向中间收拢</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/2d/ec/2dcd6ad5cf82c65b9cfc43a27ba1e4ec.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">下面举个<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">vue</code>通过<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>算法更新的例子：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">新旧<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">VNode</code>节点如下图所示：</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/80/6d/80dc339f73b186479e6d1fc18bfbf66d.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第一次循环后，发现旧节点D与新节点D相同，直接复用旧节点D作为<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>后的第一个真实节点，同时旧节点<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">endIndex</code>移动到C，新节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 C</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/76/54/76032c78c8ef74047efd42c070e48854.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第二次循环后，同样是旧节点的末尾和新节点的开头(都是 C)相同，同理，<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>&nbsp;后创建了 C 的真实节点插入到第一次创建的 B 节点后面。同时旧节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">endIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 B，新节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 E</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/1c/d7/1c76e7489660188d35f0a38ea8c8ecd7.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第三次循环中，发现E没有找到，这时候只能直接创建新的真实节点 E，插入到第二次创建的 C 节点之后。同时新节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 A。旧节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">endIndex</code>&nbsp;都保持不动</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/4b/08/4b622c0d61673ec5474465d82305d308.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第四次循环中，发现了新旧节点的开头(都是 A)相同，于是&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>&nbsp;后创建了 A 的真实节点，插入到前一次创建的 E 节点后面。同时旧节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 B，新节点的<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">&nbsp;startIndex</code>&nbsp;移动到了 B</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/59/b4/5982417c3e0b2fa9ae940354a0e67ab4.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">第五次循环中，情形同第四次循环一样，因此&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>&nbsp;后创建了 B 真实节点 插入到前一次创建的 A 节点后面。同时旧节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex&nbsp;</code>移动到了 C，新节点的 startIndex 移动到了 F</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/16/86/16cf0ef90f6e19d26c0ddffeca067e86.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">新节点的&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">startIndex</code>&nbsp;已经大于&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">endIndex</code>&nbsp;了，需要创建&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">newStartIdx</code>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">newEndIdx</code>&nbsp;之间的所有节点，也就是节点F，直接创建 F 节点对应的真实节点放到 B 节点后面</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"ant-image\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative; display: inline-block;\"><img class=\"ant-image-img\" style=\"box-sizing: content-box; vertical-align: middle; border-style: none; width: 623.333px; height: auto; max-width: 100%; background-color: #ffffff;\" src=\"https://static001.infoq.cn/resource/image/dc/ad/dc215b45682cf6c9cc4700a5425673ad.png\" />\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; position: absolute; inset: 0px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #ffffff; background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5); cursor: pointer; opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.3s ease 0s;\">\n<div class=\"ant-image-mask-info\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; padding: 0px 4px; overflow: hidden; white-space: nowrap; text-overflow: ellipsis;\">预览</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">三、原理分析</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">当数据发生改变时，<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">set</code>方法会调用<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">Dep.notify</code>通知所有订阅者<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">Watcher</code>，订阅者就会调用<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">patch</code>给真实的<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">DOM</code>打补丁，更新相应的视图</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">源码位置：src/core/vdom/patch.js</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 3.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">function</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #dad085;\">patch</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">(</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">oldVnode</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> vnode</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> hydrating</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span class=\"token parameter\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> removeOnly</span>