\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">this</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">lastName</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 3.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">12</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 3.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">13</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">我们知道 computed 内定义的 function 只执行一次，仅当初始化显示或者相关的 data、props 等属性数据发生变化的时候调用；<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />而 computed 属性值默认会缓存计算结果，计算属性是基于它们的响应式依赖进行缓存的；<br style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\" />只有当 computed 属性被使用后，才会执行 computed 的代码，在重复的调用中，只要依赖数据不变，直接取缓存中的计算结果。只有<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">依赖型数据</span>发生<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">改变</span>，computed 才会重新计算。</p>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">计算属性的高级</span>：</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">在computed 中的属性都有一个&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">get</span>&nbsp;和一个&nbsp;<span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-weight: 600;\">set</span>&nbsp;方法，当数据变化时，调用 set 方法。下面我们通过计算属性的 getter/setter 方法来实现对属性数据的显示和监视，即双向绑定。</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber