; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">)</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">该组件在使用的时候，混合了<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">mixin</code>里面的方法，在自动执行<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">create</code>生命钩子，执行<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">hello</code>方法</p>\n<h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; font-size: 1.25em;\">全局混入</h3>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">通过<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">Vue.mixin()</code>进行全局的混入</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">Vue</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token method property-access\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\