(484,5,0,0,'','3','0','为什么Vue中的v-if和v-for不建议一起用?','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">一、作用</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">v-if</code>&nbsp;指令用于条件性地渲染一块内容。这块内容只会在指令的表达式返回&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">true</code>值的时候被渲染</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">v-for</code>&nbsp;指令基于一个数组来渲染一个列表。<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">v-for</code>&nbsp;指令需要使用&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">item in items</code>&nbsp;形式的特殊语法，其中&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">items</code>&nbsp;是源数据数组或者对象，而&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">item</code>&nbsp;则是被迭代的数组元素的别名</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">在&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">v-for</code>&nbsp;的时候，建议设置<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">key</code>值，并且保证每个<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">key</code>值是独一无二的，这便于<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">diff</code>算法进行优化</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: #24292f; font-size: 16px;\">两者在用法上</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-js\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: