(521,8,0,0,'','3','0','TypeScript 的内置数据类型有哪些？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">boolean：表示布尔值，可以是 true 或 false。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">number：表示数字，包括整数和浮点数。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">string：表示字符串。可以使用单引号或双引号来表示字符串。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">void：表示没有任何返回值的函数的返回类型。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">null 和 undefined：这两个类型是所有类型的子类型。 symbol：表示独特的值，类似于数字或字符串。</li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">除此之外，TypeScript 还支持以下复合类型：</p>\n<ul style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 0px !important; padding-left: 2em;\">\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">array：表示一个元素类型为 T 的数组。例如，number[] 表示一个数字数组。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">tuple：表示已知元素数量和类型的数组。例如，[string, number] 表示一个字符串和数字组成的元组。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">enum：表示一个命名的常量枚举。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">any：表示任意类型。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">unknown：与 any 类似，但是在更严格的类型检查下使用。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">object：表示非原始类型的对象。</li>\n<li style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 0.25em;\">还有一些其他的类型，例如 never、union 和 intersection，它们可以用于描述更复杂的类型。</li>\n</ul>\n</div>',NULL,'',0,0,'2023-04-01 08:47:22',0,NULL,NULL,NULL,'小米','2023-04-01 16:47:22',0),
(522,8,0,0,'','3','0','ts中any和unknown有什么区别？','<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1p',0,'<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); font-size: 14px; background-color: #ffffff;\">\n<p class=\"answerTitle___1T-fK\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold;\">参考答案：</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"markdown-body\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \'Segoe UI\', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, \'Apple Color Emoji\', \'Segoe UI Emoji\'; text-size-adjust: 100%; margin: 0px; color: #24292f; background-color: #ffffff; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; overflow-wrap: break-word;\">\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-bottom: 16px;\">unknown 和 any 的主要区别是 unknown 类型会更加严格：在对 unknown 类型的值执行大多数操作之前，我们必须进行某种形式的检查。而在对 any 类型的值执行操作之前，我们不必进行任何检查。</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">举例说明：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: