'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">=</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">    name</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ededed;\">:</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token known-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ffffb6; text-decoration-line: underline;\">String</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">通过<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">import</code>&nbsp;引入模块，如下：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">import</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> a</span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">,</span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token imports maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">Person</span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token imports\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">from</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #a8ff60;\">\'./export\'</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">;</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<h2 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 16px; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.85); line-height: 1.25; padding-bottom: 0.3em; border-bottom: 1px solid #d8dee4;\">二、命名空间</h2>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">命名空间一个最明确的目的就是解决重名问题</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">命名空间定义了标识符的可见范围，一个标识符可在多个名字空间中定义，它在不同名字空间中的含义是互不相干的</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">这样，在一个新的名字空间中可定义任何标识符，它们不会与任何已有的标识符发生冲突，因为已有的定义都处于其他名字空间中</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\"><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">TypeScript</code>&nbsp;中命名空间使用&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">namespace</code>&nbsp;来定义，语法格式如下：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">namespace</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">SomeNameSpaceName</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">2</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">   </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">export</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">interface</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ffffb6; text-decoration-line: underline;\">ISomeInterfaceName</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">3</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">   </span><span class=\"token module\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">export</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #96cbfe;\">class</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; color: #ffffb6; text-decoration-line: underline;\">SomeClassName</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\"> </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">{</span><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">      </span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span>\n<span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 2.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">4</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">}</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">以上定义了一个命名空间&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">SomeNameSpaceName</code>，如果我们需要在外部可以调用&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">SomeNameSpaceName</code>&nbsp;中的类和接口，则需要在类和接口添加&nbsp;<code style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, \'SF Mono\', Menlo, Consolas, \'Liberation Mono\', monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0.2em 0.4em; margin: 0px; background-color: rgba(175, 184, 193, 0.2); border-radius: 6px;\">export</code>&nbsp;关键字</p>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">使用方式如下：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; position: relative;\">\n<div style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; word-spacing: normal; word-break: normal; line-height: 1.5; tab-size: 4; hyphens: none; padding: 1em; margin: 0.5em 0px; overflow: auto; border-radius: 0.3em; background: #1d1f21;\"><code class=\"language-ts\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Inconsolata, Monaco, Consolas, \'Courier New\', Courier, monospace; font-size: 13.6px; padding: 0px; margin: 0px; background-color: transparent; border-radius: 6px; display: inline; overflow: visible; border: 0px; color: #c5c8c6; text-shadow: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3) 0px 1px; direction: ltr; white-space: pre;\"><span class=\"linenumber react-syntax-highlighter-line-number\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; display: inline-block; min-width: 1.25em; padding-right: 1em; text-align: right; user-select: none; color: #7c7c7c;\">1</span><span class=\"token maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">SomeNameSpaceName</span><span class=\"token\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">.</span><span class=\"token property-access maybe-class-name\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif;\">SomeClassName</span></code></div>\n</div>\n<p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFang SC\', \'microsoft yahei\', tahoma, arial, \'Hiragino Sans GB\', sans-serif; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">命名空间本质上是一个对象，作用是将一系列相关的全局变量组织到一个对象的属性，如下：</p>\n<div class=\"codeBox___24JI7\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-family: \'PingFa